  {
   "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official AWS Device Farm API (2015-06-23). Every other official operation returns HTTP 501 UnknownOperationException. Projects, instance profiles, Selenium test grid projects and VPC endpoint configurations are configuration metadata: no device, device slot, upload, run, job, remote access session or test grid session exists, no test runs, no Selenium endpoint is served and no VPC endpoint service is contacted. ScheduleRun, CreateUpload, CreateTestGridUrl and the other run APIs return UnknownOperationException with HTTP 501. Device pools and network profiles are not implemented because they are read and changed by their own ARN without naming their project; CreateDevicePool, CreateNetworkProfile, their other operations, ListDevices, GetAccountSettings and the offering APIs return UnknownOperationException with HTTP 501. VPC, subnet, security group and role identifiers are stored without checks. ListTestGridProjects refuses maxResult. Validation failures detected by the simulator are reported as ValidationException, not the official ArgumentException code.",
   "name": "AWS Device Farm"
  }
